## Module map

| Package | Responsibility |
| --- | --- |
| `domain/` | Frozen types: IDs, modes, options, project, catalog, execution, reports |
| `config/` | Project config discovery, schema, loader |
| `catalog/` | Bundled catalog YAML, validation, loader |
| `planning/` | Suites, scopes, request resolution |
| `adapter/` | Resolved request → argv serialization |
| `runtime/` | Executor, install, environment, reports, cache, parallel, remote |
| `normalize/` | Tool output → canonical `CheckReport` |
| `formatters/` | Canonical report → human/CI text |
| `gates/` | Script-gate runtime and local-gate discovery |
| `policy/` | Bundled `PolicyGate` modules (`module:` catalog tools) |
| `frontend/` | Report UI; reads canonical reports only |
| `project/` | `init` / scaffold / project Python helpers |
| `registries/` | Shared ID registries |
| `core/` | Shared process/path utilities |
| `plugins/` | Deferred stub (Decision 005) |
| `app.py` | Orchestration with dependency injection |
| `cli.py` | argparse entrypoint only |

## Invariants

Policy separate from execution; Execution Request is the internal API; suites are the only catalog grouping for selection. See `docs/architecture.md`.
